{
  "_comment": "Sources of the morning digest. weight: focus - main topics, brief - candidates that get in only with direct use. type: feed (Atom/RSS; include/exclude - regexes on the title), page (a page without a feed: lines that were not there yesterday; format html or text; link - address for the message if another one is read), github_search (q without a date, the code adds created within days), hn (Hacker News front page, match - regex on the title).",
